r4-ex1 75 passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass Water;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Postprocessing/Hair;;passx q0|Frame/Postprocessing/CutHeight;;passx q0|Frame/Postprocessing/Bloom;;switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q0|Frame/Proxy Set Fill Streams;;passx q0|Frame/Lighting/CS Lights;;passx q51|CS Cloth
